<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>A Letter</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink: #10131a;
    --ink-2: #171b24;
    --paper: #ece4d3;
    --paper-dim: #b9b0a0;
    --gold: #c9a463;
    --gold-soft: #8a744a;
    --rose: #c98a8a;
    --line: rgba(236,228,211,0.14);
  }

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }

  html,body{
    margin:0; padding:0; height:100%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% -10%, #1b2130 0%, var(--ink) 55%, #0b0d12 100%);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: 'Iowan Old Style','Palatino Linotype', Georgia, serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }

  @font-face{
    font-family: 'DisplaySerif';
    src: local('Playfair Display');
  }

  .display{
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', 'Iowan Old Style', Georgia, serif;
  }

  .sans{
    font-family: -apple-system, 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .stage{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding: 6vh 5vw;
    position:relative;
  }

  /* faint starlight texture */
  .stage::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed; inset:0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.25), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 80% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 60% 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 85%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90% 60%, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 45% 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent);
    pointer-events:none;
    opacity:0.6;
  }

  /* ===== ENVELOPE ===== */
  #envelope-view{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    gap:2.2rem;
    z-index:2;
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  #envelope-view.hide{
    opacity:0;
    transform: translateY(-16px) scale(0.98);
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .envelope{
    width: min(340px, 78vw);
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    position:relative;
    cursor:pointer;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.55));
  }

  .env-body{
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, #1d2331, #141822);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:4px;
  }

  .env-flap{
    position:absolute;
    top:0; left:0; right:0;
    height: 62%;
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, #232a3a, #171c27);
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 50% 78%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    transform-origin: top center;
    transition: transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1);
  }

  .envelope:hover .env-flap{
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .env-seal{
    position:absolute;
    top: 46%; left:50%;
    transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
    width:46px; height:46px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #d9b273, var(--gold-soft) 70%);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    z-index:3;
  }

  .env-seal::after{
    content:"✒";
    font-size:18px;
    color: #2a2114;
    opacity:0.85;
  }

  .env-hint{
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--paper-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-align:center;
  }

  .env-to{
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    opacity:0.8;
  }

  /* ===== LETTER ===== */
  #letter-view{
    max-width: 620px;
    width: 100%;
    opacity:0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    transition: opacity 0.9s ease 0.15s, transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) 0.15s;
    z-index:2;
  }

  #letter-view.show{
    opacity:1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .letter-card{
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #14181f, #10131a 70%);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    position:relative;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .letter-card::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left: 0; top: 3.4rem; bottom: 3.4rem;
    width:1px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--gold-soft) 20%, var(--gold-soft) 80%, transparent);
    opacity:0.35;
    margin-left: 2.1rem;
  }

  .eyebrow{
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    opacity:0.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem 0;
  }

  h1{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    margin: 0 0 1.8rem 0;
    color: var(--paper);
    line-height:1.25;
  }

  .body-text p{
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: #d8cfbb;
    margin: 0 0 1.3rem 0;
  }

  .signoff{
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
    padding-top: 1.6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .signoff .closing{
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--paper-dim);
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
  }

  .signature{
    font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .stroke{
    display:block;
    width: 92px;
    height: 10px;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  .stroke path{
    fill:none;
    stroke: var(--rose);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 140;
    stroke-dashoffset: 140;
    animation: draw 1.4s ease forwards 1.1s;
  }

  @keyframes draw{
    to{ stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  }

  .footnote{
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    font-family: -apple-system, 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--paper-dim);
    opacity:0.55;
    text-align:center;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="stage">

  <!-- ============ EDIT ZONE ============
       Change the text below (NAME, and the paragraphs inside .body-text)
       to whatever you actually want to say. Everything else is styling —
       leave it as-is unless you want to tweak colors/fonts.
       ==================================== -->

  <div id="envelope-view">
    <div class="envelope" id="envelope" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Open the letter">
      <div class="env-body"></div>
      <div class="env-flap"></div>
      <div class="env-seal"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="env-to sans">For&nbsp;my&nbsp;King</div>
      <div class="env-hint">tap the envelope to open</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="letter-view">
    <div class="letter-card">
      <p class="eyebrow sans">a letter, written honestly</p>
      <h1>To the guy I once hoped to love —</h1>

      <div class="body-text">
        <p>It's been a month since we started talking, and I just wanted to let you know that I won't be pursuing you anymore. I appreciate all the times and moments that we shared together. Please know that everything I said and showed you was real and genuine. Truth is, I never really came back here to Taguig to find a job, but solely to see and be with you. At first, I was so happy and grateful because I thought I had finally found someone I could connect with, share my dreams with, and work towards achieving them together.</p>
        <p>I don't know what went wrong or if I did anything wrong, but recently, I feel like you're no longer interested in continuing whatever it is that we were trying to build and what we once talked about. And having no clarity about where we are going is not for me. This is not the kind of love I'm looking for. I've told you before that I want my next relationship to be my last, and I really wanted you to be that person despite the short time we've gotten to know each other. But it seems to me that you're not ready yet. I also remember you once said that you're pretty sure you can reciprocate as long as you feel like I'm genuine, but it seems to me that you can't, regardless of how genuine I can be.</p>
        <p>I also noticed that you're actually not ready to settle down yet. You just want to have fun and distractions, and I'm not trying to conclude anything, but I think you haven't moved on from your ex yet (yes, i saw your reposts and messenger notes last wednesday). Maybe that's something you need to reassess first before engaging in or planning to have a relationship with other people. Because if you don't, it might become a pattern- you'll get into a talking stage, the other person will get attached to you, then you'll realize you're not ready yet or don't see them in your future, and the other person will just end up getting hurt. I don't want that for you.  You're a great guy, and I know there are a lot of people trying to get your attention too. I just hope you'll be able to find someone who's worth taking a risk on. </p>
        <p>As for me, I'll keep romanticizing my life for now. I'm not flirting with anyone, and I think I'm done chasing love-for now. Instead, I'm choosing to focus on becoming a better version of myself. I get attached too quickly, so this time I'm giving myself the space and time to heal. If love finds me again, I hope it comes when I'm no longer searching for it, but simply living my life. Thank you for everything, King. You may not know it, but you helped me a lot and made me feel better and more alive throughout July. <p>Ingat palagi and if there's anything I can do to help, just let me know, ha. I'm just a chat away. I was actually planning to bring you to Baguio this weekend and ask you for us to be official but well I think that’s no longer possible. I hope we can still be friends, though.</p> <p>God bless you, and continue to do well at work.  I'm always proud of your accomplishments and will always celebrate every step of the way with you.</p>
        <p> YOOOO, IF YOURE ABLE TO READ THIS AGAIN, PLEASE KNOW THAT IM NOT REALLY GIVING UP ON YOU. IM JUST GIVING YOU THE TIME TO THINK, REFLECT AND DECIDE WETHER YOU ACTUALLY WANT SOMEONE LIKE ME IN YOUR LIFE, MESSAGE ME OKAY? I REMEMBER YOU SAID AND I QUOTE "SANA U WONT GIVE UP ON ME EVEN ON THE DAYS NA KAGIVE UP GIVE UP AKO", AND YES BABY, IM NOT GIVING UP ON YOU. IM JUST SIMPLY GIVE YOU THE TIME AND SPACE YOU NEED. I'M STILL THINKING OF YOU THO, ALWAYS. </p>
      </div>

      <div class="signoff">
        <p class="closing">Wishing you well, always, my baby —</p>
        <div class="signature">Zander</div>
        <svg class="stroke" viewBox="0 0 92 10" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 6 Q 20 -2, 40 6 T 90 5" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="footnote">this was written once, and meant once.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ END EDIT ZONE ============ -->

</div>

<script>
  const envelopeView = document.getElementById('envelope-view');
  const letterView = document.getElementById('letter-view');
  const envelope = document.getElementById('envelope');

  function openLetter(){
    envelopeView.classList.add('hide');
    setTimeout(() => {
      envelopeView.style.display = 'none';
      letterView.classList.add('show');
    }, 550);
  }

  envelope.addEventListener('click', openLetter);
  envelope.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' '){
      e.preventDefault();
      openLetter();
    }
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
